---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Workflow Automation Services | AI Workflow Toolkit" description="Request a scoped review of your agency's repetitive business process and automation opportunities.">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Done-for-you workflow design</span><h1>Get a clear plan for the work <span class="gradient">your team repeats.</span></h1><p>Start with a focused workflow audit. We will review the process, identify risks and outline a practical implementation scope. No payment is collected on this page.</p></div><div class="tool-layout"><form class="panel" id="service-form"><h2>Request a workflow audit</h2><label class="field"><span>Your email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" placeholder="you@company.com" /></label><label class="field"><span>What process slows your team down?</span><textarea name="process" rows="5" required maxlength="1500" placeholder="Describe the current process, tools and what a better outcome looks like."></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Company or role (optional)</span><input name="role" maxlength="120" placeholder="Small agency owner" /></label><label class="field"><span><input type="checkbox" required /> I agree that my details may be used to respond to this request.</span></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send request ↗</button><p class="notice">Your request is stored only if the site’s D1 database is configured. Do not include passwords or confidential client data.</p><p id="service-status" class="success" role="status"></p></form><section class="panel"><h2>What the audit includes</h2><ol><li>Map the current steps and handoffs.</li><li>Identify repeat work, missing data and failure points.</li><li>Recommend safe approval and verification points.</li><li>Deliver a scope and next-step estimate before implementation.</li></ol><p class="notice">This is an early-stage offer. Delivery availability, scope and price must be agreed before work starts.</p></section></div></div>
  <script>
    const form = document.querySelector("#service-form"); const status = document.querySelector("#service-status");
    form.addEventListener("submit", async e => {e.preventDefault(); status.textContent="Submitting…"; const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries()); try {const r=await fetch("/api/service-request",{method:"POST",headers:{"content-type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify(data)}); const out=await r.json(); if(!r.ok) throw new Error(out.error||"Could not submit request."); status.textContent=out.message||"Request received."; form.reset();} catch(err){status.textContent=err instanceof Error?err.message:"Could not submit request.";}});
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
